Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.24,0:00:14.36,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,LiZA did?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.75,0:00:17.36,Italics Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. She showed a strong response.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.36,0:00:19.12,Italics Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,More than any we've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.39,0:00:20.61,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.21,0:00:23.90,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,So the time is almost upon us, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.84,0:02:01.14,Episode Title,L,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1000,1000)}The Captured {\c&H0303C1&}Sleeping Beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.15,0:01:58.25,Main Dialogue Top,L,0000,0000,0000,,The sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.25,0:02:00.19,Main Dialogue Top,F,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Reitia!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.19,0:02:01.32,Main Dialogue Top,K,0000,0000,0000,,Nii-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.45,0:02:06.31,Main Dialogue Top,S,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think of this swimsuit?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.12,0:02:08.51,Main Dialogue Top,K,0000,0000,0000,,Do we look good in these?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.51,0:02:10.59,Main Dialogue Top,H,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.59,0:02:13.15,Main Dialogue Top,M,0000,0000,0000,,We spent a lot of time \Npicking them out yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.36,0:02:16.69,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Miharu-san. I guess you got\Ndragged into coming along with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.99,0:02:18.65,Main Dialogue,M,0000,0000,0000,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.10,0:02:21.91,Main Dialogue,M,0000,0000,0000,,I'm happy I got to come with you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.48,0:02:25.74,Main Dialogue,S,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, what are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.74,0:02:26.92,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.09,0:02:29.16,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.21,0:02:32.92,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,You're too close! Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.48,0:02:36.55,Main Dialogue,S,0000,0000,0000,,Take care of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.12,0:02:38.54,Main Dialogue,S,0000,0000,0000,,Let's swim, Hayato-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.97,0:02:38.84,Main Dialogue Top,E,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.54,0:02:39.55,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.80,0:02:41.22,Main Dialogue,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.94,0:02:43.15,Main Dialogue,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.64,0:02:49.06,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,If only I could dress like a girl \Nwhen everyone's around...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.39,0:02:52.05,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone seems to be \Nenjoying themselves, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.05,0:02:54.16,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,It was worth it to bring them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.61,0:02:56.82,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I think it'll be hard for you to swim,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.10,0:02:59.57,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,but get some relaxation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.57,0:03:01.57,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,And what've you got\N your tits hanging out for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.57,0:03:03.70,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,Are you out to seduce Hayato, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.75,0:03:06.75,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.75,0:03:08.98,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,How rude, Emile Crossfode!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.03,0:03:10.91,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.93,0:03:20.22,Main Dialogue,F,0000,0000,0000,,Now you've done it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.55,0:03:21.86,Main Dialogue,F,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.32,0:03:24.36,Main Dialogue,S,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you getting hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.66,0:03:26.64,Main Dialogue,S,0000,0000,0000,,I made lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.65,0:03:37.73,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,Disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.73,0:03:38.59,Main Dialogue,S,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.59,0:03:40.83,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,The way you keep clinging to Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.13,0:03:45.24,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,And you joined the {\i1}Little Garden{\i0}\N because you're after Hayato, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.61,0:03:50.26,Main Dialogue,S,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. I've decided to be his\Npersonal idol when I'm not performing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.85,0:03:53.21,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,I refuse to accept that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.21,0:03:56.41,Main Dialogue,S,0000,0000,0000,,And what about you? Are you \Nreally just friends with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.41,0:03:57.59,Main Dialogue,S,0000,0000,0000,,Or are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.02,0:04:01.26,Italics Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,D-Does she know I'm a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.26,0:04:03.22,Main Dialogue,S,0000,0000,0000,,Or are you into boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.19,0:04:09.03,Main Dialogue,S,0000,0000,0000,,Everybody's talking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.03,0:04:11.99,Main Dialogue,S,0000,0000,0000,,Saying how it's fishy that you two are\Nall over each other, even though you're guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.57,0:04:14.60,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.60,0:04:18.86,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato and I are close because \Nwe used to be together in Gudenburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.86,0:04:20.40,Main Dialogue,S,0000,0000,0000,,You, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.40,0:04:21.05,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.05,0:04:23.29,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,We were childhood friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.29,0:04:24.36,Main Dialogue,S,0000,0000,0000,,Then I'm also...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.64,0:04:26.35,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.35,0:04:30.12,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,I heard that you were \Nonly together for a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.63,0:04:32.91,Main Dialogue,S,0000,0000,0000,,We're still childhood friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.91,0:04:35.97,Main Dialogue,K,0000,0000,0000,,I've been with my brother since I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.64,0:04:40.25,Main Dialogue,K,0000,0000,0000,,So maybe I'm his biggest childhood friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.07,0:04:44.76,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for the food, Sakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.26,0:04:46.73,Main Dialogue,S,0000,0000,0000,,Did you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.73,0:04:49.11,Main Dialogue,K,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, it was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.11,0:04:51.10,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it wasn't bad, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.11,0:04:54.10,Main Dialogue,L,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato! Emile!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.10,0:04:56.15,Main Dialogue,L,0000,0000,0000,,What say we work off\Nthe calories with a game?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.46,0:04:58.40,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, I'm in!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.73,0:05:02.56,Main Dialogue,S,0000,0000,0000,,You can do it, Hayato-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.56,0:05:03.82,Main Dialogue,K,0000,0000,0000,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.97,0:05:03.82,Main Dialogue Top,L,0000,0000,0000,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.46,0:05:13.00,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, are you allowed to use Energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.43,0:05:15.16,Main Dialogue,L,0000,0000,0000,,Is that a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.16,0:05:18.38,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,Then I'll use Energy, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.73,0:05:29.14,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um... Claire-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.92,0:05:33.68,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Would you be kind enough to\Nlet me rub some on the front, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.68,0:05:35.64,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'll do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.21,0:05:37.35,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Here, Claire-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.35,0:05:38.29,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.29,0:05:39.80,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,This is my job!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.80,0:05:42.33,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Claire-sama, let me do your front.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.33,0:05:44.72,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,No, leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.72,0:05:45.29,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,No, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.29,0:05:46.36,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.62,0:05:49.11,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.11,0:05:50.07,Main Dialogue,L,0000,0000,0000,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.07,0:05:52.55,Main Dialogue,L,0000,0000,0000,,Reitia #1 Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.62,0:05:54.62,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.68,0:06:00.78,Main Dialogue,,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.20,0:06:06.74,Main Dialogue,S,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Hayato-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.74,0:06:08.39,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.79,0:06:14.25,Main Dialogue,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.47,0:06:17.48,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,The Warslarn Inc. Crest?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.90,0:06:26.61,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,Judar-oniisama.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.86,0:06:28.00,Main Dialogue,F,0000,0000,0000,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.00,0:06:29.70,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,...the CEO of Warslarn?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.24,0:06:32.41,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Hello. It's been so long, Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.97,0:06:35.11,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,That swimsuit looks great on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.11,0:06:37.00,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,Spare me the flattery.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.00,0:06:39.05,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,That was quite the entrance, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.35,0:06:41.77,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,What brings you all the way out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.45,0:06:45.75,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to see you \Nas soon as I possibly could.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.49,0:06:52.51,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,And I thought I would see these brave \Nfuture soldiers of Warslarn in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.41,0:06:55.47,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,So you're Kisaragi Hayato-kun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.47,0:06:56.02,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.41,0:07:00.75,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,You surpassed my sister's response values\N before you even joined.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.06,0:07:03.19,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,You're the {\i1}Little Garden{\i0}'s rising star.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.96,0:07:06.53,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,And the holder of the divine blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.66,0:07:10.16,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, just talking to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.16,0:07:11.51,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.64,0:07:15.03,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,And you're Emili...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.46,0:07:18.41,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,No, Emile Crossfode, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.70,0:07:19.79,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.31,0:07:23.08,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,I'm told the rest of you\N all have bright futures, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.08,0:07:24.22,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,I expect great things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.29,0:07:26.41,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,All right, Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.71,0:07:28.85,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,I'll take you back to the \N{\i1}Little Garden{\i0} in my helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.15,0:07:29.80,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.38,0:07:33.76,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,It seems something's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.10,0:07:35.24,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Claire-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.24,0:07:36.94,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,No need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.86,0:07:45.90,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,What was with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.29,0:07:47.14,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.13,0:07:51.27,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,The Student Council President?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.27,0:07:54.19,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,She says come to the Student \NCouncil Room immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.99,0:07:57.79,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,An anti-Savage cleanup operation?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.13,0:07:58.90,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.90,0:08:02.38,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,This operation will be performed \Nunder the guidance of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.38,0:08:05.07,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,the UN's joint operations task force, \Nthe Peacekeeping Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.07,0:08:09.89,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,So {\i1}Little Garden{\i0} is sending \Nmembers from the Selections.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.74,0:08:14.18,Main Dialogue,F,0000,0000,0000,,Um, why were we called here, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.47,0:08:17.87,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,You're going to officially \Njoin the Selections,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.87,0:08:19.93,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,and participate in this operation!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.42,0:08:23.88,Main Dialogue,R,0000,0000,0000,,We did, Fritz!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.88,0:08:26.04,Main Dialogue,R,0000,0000,0000,,We're in the Selections!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.04,0:08:27.65,Main Dialogue,F,0000,0000,0000,,Yup. Let's do our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.84,0:08:30.23,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.11,0:08:33.91,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.53,0:08:36.45,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to have a little chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.48,0:08:39.49,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,May I have a moment of your time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.69,0:08:41.80,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.83,0:08:45.66,Main Dialogue,L,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, Fritz! Let's train!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.66,0:08:47.20,Main Dialogue,F,0000,0000,0000,,All right. I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.20,0:08:48.21,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.95,0:08:56.58,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.58,0:08:57.50,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.50,0:08:58.64,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.97,0:09:01.90,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know what the power \Nsource of {\i1}Little Garden{\i0} is?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.05,0:09:04.92,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.92,0:09:08.24,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,A nuclear fusion reactor, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.24,0:09:09.60,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Only on paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.41,0:09:21.23,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,The power source for this \Nmassive academy city ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.84,0:09:24.51,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,the power source for all of our research...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.13,0:09:27.89,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Little Garden{\i0} requires \Nmassive amounts of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.69,0:09:32.59,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,More than you can get out \Nof a fusion reactor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.64,0:09:40.10,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,So what is it that\N really powers {\i1}Little Garden?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.15,0:09:42.85,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,This is the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.72,0:10:23.47,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Just like Sleeping Beauty \Nin the fairy tale, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.65,0:10:30.02,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,She is the power source of {\i1}Little Garden,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.02,0:10:31.61,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,and its supreme commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.89,0:10:33.89,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,LiZA.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.17,0:10:37.66,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,This is LiZA?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.58,0:10:39.33,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.05,0:10:43.87,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,And the first Slayer and Variant \Ncreated by mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.79,0:10:46.04,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Liza Harvey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.59,0:10:48.47,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,Harvey?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.52,0:10:52.79,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,My sister, and Claire's.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.64,0:10:56.69,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.74,0:10:59.75,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,President!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.74,0:11:03.71,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you bring Kisaragi Hayato here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.47,0:11:05.66,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.66,0:11:08.48,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure if Liza woke up and saw
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.48,0:11:11.60,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,you pointed that at me, \Nshe'd be very shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.05,0:11:14.98,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,She'd say you've turned \Ninto quite the tomboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.26,0:11:17.35,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,Answer my question!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.30,0:11:21.60,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,I'm certain that in the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.90,0:11:25.05,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,he's going to be one of \NWarslarn's top Slayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.98,0:11:30.63,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,So he should know that there's something in\N{\i1}Little Garden{\i0} that needs to be protected at all costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.34,0:11:35.61,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Something that could change the\Nvery power balance of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.61,0:11:37.71,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,And who better than myself to tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.83,0:11:39.59,Main Dialogue,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.25,0:11:43.76,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,Would you please not call my sister a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.61,0:11:45.88,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.56,0:11:50.23,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,But that's not the only reason\NI brought him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.80,0:11:52.94,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,He has the divine blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.26,0:11:56.23,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,He might able to awaken Liza.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.33,0:11:58.78,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.51,0:12:00.43,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato-kun,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.95,0:12:04.31,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,it's time for you to awaken Sleeping Beauty \Nfrom her eternal slumber.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.08,0:12:07.99,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Now, give her a wake-up kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.23,0:12:09.49,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,K-Kiss?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.49,0:12:10.87,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.40,0:12:13.88,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,It was a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.88,0:12:15.54,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,The kiss is our method of last resort.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.10,0:12:20.01,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,For now, just touch the capsule \Nand release your energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.63,0:12:21.88,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,Try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.18,0:12:59.07,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,Liza!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.72,0:13:13.28,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.66,0:13:16.13,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,it seems that wasn't enough to wake her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.63,0:13:19.51,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,I'm in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.82,0:13:21.38,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,As long as that woman's alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.38,0:13:23.96,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,she may come after Liza.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.66,0:13:26.78,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Vitaly Tynyanov is her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.96,0:13:28.78,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,Vitaly?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.45,0:13:31.81,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,She and I have a past.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.33,0:13:34.54,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,I need to capture her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.12,0:13:40.42,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I want to have a talk \Nwith her servants, the Hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.73,0:13:42.90,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,Then this cleanup operation...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.90,0:13:44.20,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,I'm done talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.62,0:13:45.75,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.89,0:13:52.87,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Why not have a nice long chat with \NHayato-kun in front of your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.87,0:13:54.28,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.71,0:13:58.50,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,If a talented Slayer were \Nto join the Harvey family,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.50,0:14:01.01,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,that would make me very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.55,0:14:02.90,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think, Hayato-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.87,0:14:05.36,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,Judar, what are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.02,0:14:10.44,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,It was just a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.44,0:14:12.39,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't expect you to react so strongly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.87,0:14:14.47,Main Dialogue,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be on my way, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.88,0:14:29.38,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,You're not asking anything, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.96,0:14:33.64,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,You didn't look like you wanted me to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.07,0:14:37.99,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,I'll tell you when it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.60,0:14:40.45,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.34,0:14:44.51,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,Keep what you heard and saw there a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.12,0:14:47.28,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,That is an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.10,0:14:49.29,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.56,0:14:50.22,Main Dialogue,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.64,0:14:55.29,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go over the plan once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.87,0:14:59.87,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,This is a map of the mountains near\NTian Quan City in the Empire of Qin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.06,0:15:05.55,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,We estimate that there are \Naround 50 Savages in this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.08,0:15:08.09,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Our base camp is in Tian Quan City.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.09,0:15:09.92,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,That's where Xuemei was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.37,0:15:14.62,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,If there's something you don't understand, \Nask her. She's our guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.62,0:15:16.60,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'll be happy to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.99,0:15:22.60,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,And there's a chance those three\N will appear during this mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.07,0:15:26.52,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,One of the reasons you were \Nchosen for this mission
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.52,0:15:29.17,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,was because you've fought them before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.17,0:15:34.38,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,Judar-sama believes it'll be easier to deal \Nwith them if you know about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.92,0:15:38.33,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,Then LiZA didn't pick these members?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.33,0:15:39.14,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.14,0:15:44.33,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,It was Judar-sama who proposed \Nthis clean-up operation to the UN.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.91,0:15:50.59,Main Dialogue,L,0000,0000,0000,,We were told about this,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.99,0:15:53.51,Main Dialogue,L,0000,0000,0000,,but I guess this really is a big mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.01,0:15:56.00,Main Dialogue,L,0000,0000,0000,,I'm getting excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.00,0:15:59.58,Main Dialogue,F,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, it's a little too early to \Nstart getting fired up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.58,0:16:01.36,Main Dialogue,F,0000,0000,0000,,The fight's tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.74,0:16:01.92,Main Dialogue,L,0000,0000,0000,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.92,0:16:03.82,Main Dialogue,L,0000,0000,0000,,Don't put your hand on my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.00,0:16:06.82,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,We're going, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.16,0:16:12.86,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Emilia-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.48,0:16:15.02,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.02,0:16:16.95,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Princess Emilia!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.62,0:16:20.73,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I missed you, Emilia-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.73,0:16:21.69,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.69,0:16:22.96,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You've got the wrong person!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.96,0:16:26.64,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,You can dress like a man, \Nbut you can't fool me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.64,0:16:28.99,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure that you're Princess Em...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.39,0:16:30.70,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.05,0:16:34.24,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.42,0:16:40.80,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I was sure if I came here,\N I could meet you, Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.80,0:16:42.69,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,Stop calling me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.07,0:16:46.06,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,What's with this princess thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.06,0:16:48.17,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,What's with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.17,0:16:48.99,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.99,0:16:52.36,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Emile's classmate, Kisaragi Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.36,0:16:55.01,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,Claudia, when you ask someone their name,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.01,0:16:57.05,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,you're supposed to give your own name first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.91,0:17:01.28,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Claudia Loetty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.28,0:17:04.85,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,I'm from Gudenburg, part of \Nthe Federation of Britannia,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.85,0:17:07.30,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,and a Britannia Unified Army Slayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.30,0:17:10.09,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,And Emilia-sama's childhood friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.09,0:17:10.88,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,That's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.32,0:17:13.38,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,I see. Nice to meet...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.38,0:17:16.34,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Emilia-sama, please come back to Gudenburg!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.79,0:17:18.98,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,I knew that was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.98,0:17:23.15,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone's waiting for the return of \NEmilia Gudenburg, the hidden princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.15,0:17:23.89,Main Dialogue,,0000,0000,0000,,Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.13,0:17:26.28,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,Th-The hidden princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.28,0:17:27.53,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.53,0:17:29.75,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,It's, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.75,0:17:30.79,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,Emile?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.38,0:17:37.87,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato, there's actually a secret \NI've been keeping for ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.34,0:17:42.30,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,The name I gave you ten years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.30,0:17:45.78,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,Emilia Hermit, is a fake name.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.78,0:17:48.99,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,My real name is Emilia Gudenburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.99,0:17:52.25,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,In other words, a princess \Nof the Gudenburg royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.85,0:17:53.76,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,A princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.61,0:17:57.31,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for keeping it a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.31,0:17:59.96,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,And I may be a princess,\Nbut I'm just the third in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.17,0:18:00.46,Main Dialogue Top,,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.96,0:18:02.60,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Emilia-sama, when this mission is over,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.60,0:18:04.79,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,let's go back to Gudenburg together!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.08,0:18:07.42,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.04,0:18:13.90,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,I've decided that I'm never\Ngoing back to Gudenburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.90,0:18:18.16,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,But... do you know how lonely \NI've been without you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.02,0:18:21.73,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.73,0:18:22.86,Main Dialogue Top,E,0000,0000,0000,,Claudia!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.73,0:18:25.11,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Please, come back for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.11,0:18:26.62,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.15,0:18:31.42,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,I love Hayato more than\N you love me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.72,0:18:34.33,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,So I won't go back to Gudenburg!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.94,0:18:41.77,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,In other words, \Neverything is that man's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.88,0:18:44.81,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Is that correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.30,0:18:48.56,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.87,0:18:51.65,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Have a duel with me,\Nand the winner gets Emilia-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.73,0:18:58.65,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,How did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.34,0:19:03.40,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,If I win, I'm taking Emilia-sama \Nback to Gudenburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.40,0:19:07.42,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,If, by some miracle, you win,\N she stays on the {\i1}Little Garden.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.42,0:19:08.29,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.92,0:19:11.67,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,But we've got the mission tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.67,0:19:13.59,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,and this dojo is also...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.86,0:19:16.61,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Xuemei-neesama told me the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.61,0:19:19.01,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,This is our dojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.01,0:19:20.79,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Feel free to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.79,0:19:23.90,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato, win for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.37,0:19:26.81,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.12,0:19:29.07,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,It's a one-round fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.07,0:19:31.79,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,First to hit the other wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.79,0:19:33.15,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,No using Hundreds, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.15,0:19:35.57,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,and no using Sense Energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.90,0:19:36.65,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.33,0:19:40.80,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,You're fighting with a \Nweak weapon like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.80,0:19:43.25,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,No complaining later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.99,0:19:46.97,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,I trained in kendo with this in Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.58,0:19:48.58,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.91,0:19:50.91,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,Then I won't hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.24,0:19:55.13,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.37,0:19:58.03,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Wh—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.42,0:20:01.81,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,That was just a little test!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.81,0:20:03.81,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Watch me, Emilia-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.81,0:20:06.01,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll beat the living shit out of him—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.01,0:20:07.83,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,You're so cool, Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.66,0:20:11.68,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,E-Emilia-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.62,0:20:15.06,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,You're going to pay for \Nseducing Emilia-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.03,0:20:17.12,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,I did not!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.12,0:20:18.40,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,No more talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.74,0:20:19.99,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,Prepare to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.90,0:20:27.44,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,You playboy! Manwhore!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.44,0:20:28.62,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,That's not what's going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.02,0:20:36.46,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,I knew I couldn't let \NEmilia-sama stay with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.76,0:20:39.97,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,I will win this fight, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.73,0:20:54.82,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,Take this, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.06,0:21:15.04,Main Dialogue,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,The match is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.40,0:21:16.52,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.52,0:21:17.29,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,You won!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.29,0:21:18.58,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,That's my Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.58,0:21:20.30,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Emile!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.30,0:21:23.01,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,N-Not bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.36,0:21:25.16,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.55,0:21:27.38,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, that's enough practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.38,0:21:29.18,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,The duel is a three-round fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.48,0:21:31.30,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,Nobody said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.71,0:21:33.78,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, best of five?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.78,0:21:34.92,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,Not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.86,0:21:38.19,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,Then we can play rock, paper, scissors.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.52,0:21:41.35,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Emile, would it hurt \Nthat much to go home for a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.35,0:21:42.15,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.26,0:21:47.98,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,So give up on taking me home with you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.98,0:21:49.16,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.61,0:21:53.50,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,I'm never giving up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.50,0:21:56.92,Main Dialogue,C,0000,0000,0000,,I'll get you for this, Kisaragi Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.25,0:22:00.38,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,Sheesh...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.57,0:22:06.45,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,I still can't believe you're \Na princess, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.45,0:22:09.98,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.98,0:22:11.64,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.62,0:22:14.17,Main Dialogue,E,0000,0000,0000,,Look, fried Xiaolongbao!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.17,0:22:16.09,Main Dialogue,H,0000,0000,0000,,You're so silly.
